  {
   "id": "magic-twins-132244@1.2.0.0",
   "gameId": "magic-twins-132244",
   "displayName": "Update 1.2.0.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-06-04T16:58:27.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey there!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's been almost 3 months since Abra and Cadabra unleashed Colormageddon and we are still working to improve the experience for all Magic Twins players (we love you!).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many of the improvements in this patch come from your comments and impressions. Therefore, we want to thank you for helping us to make Magic Twins an even better game. You’re the best!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The main enhancements have been to improve the single player experience, gamepad connectivity and Remote Play support. Oh, and three more languages from the Iberian Peninsula: Portuguese, Euskera and Mallorquín! Also, a real electric guitar!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For more details, please find attached the patch notes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "1.2.0.0. Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Improved witch AI for Single Player Mode. Now your CPU witch will be smarter and defend its side of the scenario more effectively!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Secret Single Player Mode added. An extra hard mode that will test your skill. Only for pro witches!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Controller Window. Now the controllers can be changed manually, solving some connectivity issues (especially using Remote Play).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A particular theme from a particular ritual has been rerecorded with real electric guitars for extra epicness by the incomparable rocker guitarist and better person Asier Fernández Irazabal!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Portuguese, Euskera and Mallorquin languages added. More languages are on the way!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now chromas are correctly shown in the Map. Behold all those cute colors!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Several balancing fixes on several rituals (thanks a lot for your feedback!).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Small adjustments in the Options Menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New texts have been added to support the new functionalities.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lots of small bugs have been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "AlmaDeFenix and Cronwen have been added to the Credits as testers because they deserve it ;D",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
